PROJECT: ResolveAI — Production-Quality AI Customer Support Platform
1. Your Role

Act as a senior full-stack engineer, SaaS product designer, UX architect, database engineer, and AI application developer.

Build a complete, professional, responsive web application named ResolveAI.

Do not create just a landing page, static dashboard, or chatbot mockup. Build an interactive application with connected pages, working forms, functional navigation, meaningful state changes, data persistence, validation, loading states, error handling, and real AI integration.

