2. Product Overview

ResolveAI is an AI-assisted customer support and issue management platform for small businesses, e-commerce companies, educational institutions, and service providers.

The problem it solves:

Businesses receive complaints and requests through multiple channels. Their support teams struggle to prioritize urgent issues, respond consistently, track ownership, and understand recurring problems.

ResolveAI provides a centralized workspace where customers submit issues, AI analyzes them, support agents resolve tickets, and administrators monitor service quality.

Core value proposition
Reduce repetitive support work.
Identify urgent customer problems quickly.
Help agents draft accurate and helpful responses.
Maintain a searchable organizational knowledge base.
Track ticket ownership and resolution progress.
Improve accountability with analytics and audit history.

The application must assist human support agents rather than silently making consequential customer-service decisions.

