Create an AI service layer separate from the user interface.

Feature A: Automatic ticket analysis

When a ticket is created or an agent requests analysis, send the relevant ticket content to Gemini.

Ask the model to return structured JSON containing:

Category.
Sentiment.
Recommended priority.
Short summary.
Detected customer intent.
Suggested next action.
Confidence indicator.
