Feature B: AI reply generator

Add a button labeled "Generate Reply".

The agent can choose a tone:

Professional.
Friendly.
Concise.
Empathetic.

The assistant should produce a relevant draft using the ticket context and approved knowledge-base information.

Allow agents to:

